  "label": {
    "en": [
      "A black-and-white postcard showing a busy harbor scene with several steamships docked along the pier. There are people walking and working on the dock, with piles of cargo and a warehouse visible. The harbor stretches into the distance, with industrial buildings and more ships. The overall style suggests an early 20th-century setting. The text 'Sundsvalls Hamnen.' is visible in the lower left corner."
